ays false: \n\n$$\n\\overbrace{P}^{\\text{Always false}}⇒\\,Q\n$$\n\nIt does not matter whether the consequent is true or false. \n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our antecedents in turn.\n\n- Statement I is always true. $\\,\\times $\n\n- Statement II is always false. $\\,✓$\n\n- Predicate III, defined for $x\\in R,$ is *not* always false. $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186384719 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157233 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "45f828cb-c8b1-5da4-9711-15ace712dffa" :knowledge-point/title "Completing Vacuous Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8c7fc458-0426-5cb1-b0f0-1e31fe748ab3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471341} {:answer/id #uuid "47405ffc-cfec-5943-9bf9-2b89f47af34f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471342}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8c7fc458-0426-5cb1-b0f0-1e31fe748ab3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471341} :answer-field/id #uuid "552f79a8-e7b3-522e-8b3d-7198b74bc8d0" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472176} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9bd9c434-2c4b-562c-839d-16f535749a96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471343} {:answer/id #uuid "70dacb19-1349-50ce-91a6-ff0482a093eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471344}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9bd9c434-2c4b-562c-839d-16f535749a96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/